<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Welcome to the Dukka team
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Staff account created
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Your Dukka staff account has been created for <strong>{{email}}</strong>. You now have access to the tools and workspaces assigned to your role.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Staff email" value=email}}
  {{#if roleName}}
  {{> detail-row label="Assigned role" value=roleName}}
  {{/if}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Next steps"}}
  Sign in with the password you set when accepting your invitation. If you forget it, use password reset from the staff portal.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  We are glad to have you on board — let’s build great experiences together.
</p>
